<title>PHILIPPINES: WMC Manila unit plans $450 mln investments.</title>
<headline>WMC Manila unit plans $450 mln investments.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-08-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australia's WMC Ltd is planning to invest $450 million over the next five years as its copper and gold mining project starts operation this year, an official of its local subsidiary said on Friday.</p>
<p>WMC (Philippines) Inc project manager Terence Gardner told a news conference the investment is on top of the 400 million pesos already spent for exploration activities since 1987.</p>
<p>He said the company is still completing its detailed exploration activities to determine the quantity and quality of its mineral deposits in its southern Philippine mine site.</p>
<p>- Manila newsroom 63 2 8418938 Fax 8176267</p>
</text>
